Description: A domain-driven e-commerce framework for Django
 Django Oscar is an open-source eCommerce framework written in Python using the
 Django web framework. Unlike other eCommerce systems, it doesn't try to be a
 turnkey solution but rather provides building blocks for constructing flexible
 and scalable eCommerce sites.

