Description: Django Oscar service infrastructure for server deployment
  This package provides systemd and uWSGI configuration templates for running a
  Django Oscar-based e-commerce site as a system service.
 .
 It installs:
  - A systemd unit file at /lib/systemd/system/django-oscar.service
  - A uwsgi.ini template at /etc/django-oscar/uwsgi.ini
  - An environment.conf template at /etc/django-oscar/environment.conf
 .
 You still need to create your own Django project using django-admin startproject
 and configure it to use Oscar. See README.Debian for setup instructions.
